<item><title>Uganda targets 500,000 metric tonnes of cocoa a year by 2036</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-targets-500-000-metric-tonnes-of-cocoa-a-year-by-2036-3df285/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-targets-500-000-metric-tonnes-of-cocoa-a-year-by-2036-3df285/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The first national cocoa strategy also seeks $3 billion in annual export earnings and 30% local processing by 2036.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda tourism board backs AFCON 2027 logo to market the country</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-tourism-board-backs-afcon-2027-logo-to-market-the-423873/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-tourism-board-backs-afcon-2027-logo-to-market-the-423873/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The board holds tournament marketing rights under a 30 October deal with CAF and wants fans attending in Uganda to visit beyond match days.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:00:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Green Climate Fund approves $3.5 million for Uganda climate finance</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/green-climate-fund-approves-3-5-million-for-uganda-climate-cf6d33/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/green-climate-fund-approves-3-5-million-for-uganda-climate-cf6d33/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The 48-month grant will help the finance ministry prepare projects for funding and coordinate institutions seeking climate finance.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 06:34:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda suspends mass gatherings in 34 Ebola-risk border districts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-5420d2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-5420d2/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>The health ministry also requires returning Ugandans from the DRC to undergo risk assessments and 21-day quarantine or monitored self-isolation.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:12:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-5420d2/share.jpg" length="43663" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-suspends-mass-gatherings-in-34-ebola-risk-border-5420d2/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Uganda to expand business support for entrepreneurs under new framework</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-to-expand-business-support-for-entrepreneurs-under-795aea/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ug/uganda-to-expand-business-support-for-entrepreneurs-under-795aea/</guid><category>Uganda</category><description>Minister Shartsi Musherure says management, productivity and financial discipline must accompany loans and infrastructure as Uganda targets a $500 billion economy by 2040.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:50:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" length="32020" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ug.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
